Kconfiglib, vendored unmodified from the sysprog21 fork

    https://github.com/sysprog21/Kconfiglib
    commit 6d9102abd55b614d3c6133529ffa40dbea7fd2cf (version 15.0.0)

Only the library and the tools the build uses are kept. Use update.sh
to update them, optionally passing a branch, tag or commit; it also
updates the hash above.
Glue code lives in scripts/kconfig/.
